@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "voimed" as Daemon
participant "Voime addon" as Addon
participant "Fcitx InputPanel" as Panel
participant "Fcitx UI" as UI

Daemon -> Addon : Partial { segment_id, text }
Addon -> Addon : 目标存在且聚焦？
Addon -> Panel : setPreedit(Text(partial))
Addon -> UI : updateUserInterface(InputPanel)
UI -> UI : 显示临时文本

Daemon -> Addon : Final { segment_id, text }
Addon -> Panel : setPreedit(Text())
Addon -> UI : updateUserInterface(InputPanel)
UI -> UI : 关闭 / 空白窗口

note over Addon, Panel
  Toggle 会话在 Final 后写入单个空格，
  保留空白面板直到 toggle off 或目标失焦。
end note
@enduml
